  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the extraction process of copper, the product obtained after carrying out the reactions</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#160;(i)&#160;</mtext><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#160;(ii)&#160;</mtext><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>Cu</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is called</p>",
